{"steam_appid":3461270,"steam_name":"XenoHaven","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3461270/679670371/4c5a3b20d4575ca434775a67683a94d95a89febf/1790582416/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790585635","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257438118/202e2c9ac5bb41d7e3e114b944dd088d3514792e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790585635","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/e2555a485aa58335c96c59612a824e420e7e2b2f/ss_e2555a485aa58335c96c59612a824e420e7e2b2f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790698127","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/0af9ce8497131efa389edba589fdd93c065a4d51/ss_0af9ce8497131efa389edba589fdd93c065a4d51.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790698127","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/f1932d5ac331ffd62aac92719a98030fadabb25f/ss_f1932d5ac331ffd62aac92719a98030fadabb25f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790698127","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/b941d9bb07a762512245a834fa75c7f48a242526/ss_b941d9bb07a762512245a834fa75c7f48a242526.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790698127","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/e16c0138dcb500390e7d56a386c55e9da553d03a/ss_e16c0138dcb500390e7d56a386c55e9da553d03a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790698127"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/46686e5b46aa3e1cc3464ad91fc43931.avif?t=1790698127\" width=1200 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit familiars and put them to work around the base. Assign them to farming, mining, cooking, crafting, and more. Watch a barren patch of land grow into a thriving home.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/3e6bf3ff5bb7930b2e97f96bf8bc7aea.poster.avif?t=1790698127\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/3e6bf3ff5bb7930b2e97f96bf8bc7aea.webm?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/3e6bf3ff5bb7930b2e97f96bf8bc7aea.mp4?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Familiars are more than just helping hands. Improve their attributes and shape each one for battle, then assemble a powerful squad ready to face the dangers beyond the base.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/abc59d0b14c4e44a899697c096ecae24.poster.avif?t=1790698127\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/abc59d0b14c4e44a899697c096ecae24.webm?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/abc59d0b14c4e44a899697c096ecae24.mp4?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/542d0cf14ebdb9f080e7586d94cfa2cf.avif?t=1790698127\" width=1200 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now featuring LAN co-op for up to 4 players and Steam Workshop support.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the journey with friends. Farm together, run a shop, explore new regions, and see just how much this alien world has to offer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0c18521e0c01851726116e7b872d7b56.poster.avif?t=1790698127\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0c18521e0c01851726116e7b872d7b56.webm?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/0c18521e0c01851726116e7b872d7b56.mp4?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape each area to suit the way you want to live. Create entirely new themes through Steam Workshop, but don’t focus on comfort alone. A good home still needs to hold its ground.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/f36546d6cbbe37ee23239c9a217d9f98.poster.avif?t=1790698127\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/f36546d6cbbe37ee23239c9a217d9f98.webm?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/f36546d6cbbe37ee23239c9a217d9f98.mp4?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/f7de93e465ced690ce40cc0d3e577240.avif?t=1790698127\" width=1200 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming and mining alone won’t get you far. Explore dangerous dungeons and take on rival factions. Collect hundreds of weapons and pieces of gear to strengthen your squad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Empire comes calling, will you submit or fight back? The fate of this world rests on your choice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/6e88a3f3ab0687b00d7f29c30cddd067.poster.avif?t=1790698127\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/6e88a3f3ab0687b00d7f29c30cddd067.webm?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/6e88a3f3ab0687b00d7f29c30cddd067.mp4?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/144f1f7822a570e10fd2a415a195e4b5.avif?t=1790698127\" width=1200 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce goods, stock the shop, and attract merchants from far and wide. Turn the base into a bustling haven where trade never stops.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/2d77f1124369dc7661f639f74947250f.poster.avif?t=1790698127\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/2d77f1124369dc7661f639f74947250f.webm?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/2d77f1124369dc7661f639f74947250f.mp4?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a popular restaurant and make it worth the trip. Develop signature dishes while offering food, entertainment, and lodging under one roof. Draw merchants from across the galaxy and earn a name in interstellar business.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/65dc4722f3760fed04acbde289179c16.poster.avif?t=1790698127\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/65dc4722f3760fed04acbde289179c16.webm?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/65dc4722f3760fed04acbde289179c16.mp4?t=1790698127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10 &amp; Win11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 or AMD Radeon HD 7750<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10 &amp; Win11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Miniverse Game"],"publishers":["OKJOY"],"release_date":"Sep 28, 2026"}